; LMG Tripod — RMB-hold buff. Pins the player in place and drains
; resource per second; in exchange every shot fired during the hold
; gets a +0.30 accuracy boost (flat, on top of the LMG's rolled
; 0.55-0.75 accuracy). Turns the LMG from "spray-and-pray volume"
; into a precision suppression weapon when the situation warrants
; standing still.

